        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001243"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A forest biome which contains densely packed populations or communities of broadleaf trees, strongly limiting light penetration to the forest floor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
