            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Soil which has increased levels of molecules or ions capable of donating a hydron (proton or hydrogen ion) to other chemical entities, or, alternatively, capable of forming covalent bonds with other chemicals via the acceptance of an electron pair, resulting in a bulk pH measurement of less than 7.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">acidic soil</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
