                </owl:someValuesFrom>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A terrestrial ecosystem which is inundated or saturated by surface or ground water at a frequency and duration sufficient to support, and that under normal circumstances does support, a prevalence of vegetation typically adapted for life in saturated soil conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EcoLexicon:wetland</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FTT:1001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
