        <obo:IAO_0000115>A building which is primarily used to facilitate the buying or selling of goods or services.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>&quot;Commerce includes legal, economic, political, social, cultural and technological systems that are in operation in any country or internationally.&quot;</rdfs:comment>
