        <obo:IAO_0000115>A planned environmental usage process during which an environment supports manufacturing facilities producing commodities that are sold with the expectation of recovering the total cost of production.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by rdf:resource="http://orcid.org/0000-0002-4366-3088"/>
