        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_2000015"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Energy possessed by an object because of its position relative to other objects, stresses within itself, its electric charge, or other factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
