        <obo:IAO_0000115>The smallest division of the artery located between the muscular arteries and the capillaries[GO].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Multi-tissue structure part of the blood vasculature, feeds into capillaries. Arterioles carry blood away from the heart.[TAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Small, terminal branch of an artery which generally connects to capillaries.[AAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
