        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An instance of a Russian-operated Earth satellite carrying biological samples. Launched July 19, 2014 and returned to Earth September 1, 2014</obo:IAO_0000115>
